OL,3,CFamily pay tribute to grandfather with
OL,4,C'heart of gold'
OL,6,FThe family of a man whose body was
OL,7,Ffound at a house in Barnsley last week
OL,8,Fsay he had a 'heart of gold'.
OL,10,FSixty-two-year-old Stephen Grimmer's
OL,11,Fbody was discovered on the night of
OL,12,FFriday 14 August after police were
OL,13,Fcalled to George Street in Worsbrough
OL,14,FBridge after earlier that day being
OL,15,Fcalled to reports of a missing
OL,16,FSheffield man.
OL,18,FHe was pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/4
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
