CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1787059119
OL,3,CFamily pay tribute to grandfather with
OL,4,C'heart of gold'
OL,6,FIn a statement paying tribute to
OL,7,FStephen, his family say he was a
OL,8,F'loving husband, father, grandfather
OL,9,Fand brother.'
OL,11,F"He would go out of his way to help
OL,12,Fanyone and was liked by everyone who
OL,13,Fknew him.
OL,15,F"He lived for holidays with his family
OL,16,Fand had planned on travelling to Spain
OL,17,Fthe evening that he was tragically
OL,18,Fkilled."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/4
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,337,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1787059119
OL,3,CFamily pay tribute to grandfather with
OL,4,C'heart of gold'
OL,6,FHis family wrote that he was proud of
OL,7,Fhis army service in the Duke of
OL,8,FWellington regiment and that friends
OL,9,Fhe made there were like brothers.
OL,11,F"He loved his body art, as his face
OL,12,Ftattoos prove, and although he could
OL,13,Foften look quite intimidating, he was
OL,14,Freally as soft as a brush and had a
OL,15,Fheart of gold."
OL,17,FSixty-two-year-old Andrew Fowler has
OL,18,Fbeen charged with his murder and
OL,19,Fappeared at Magistrates Court this
OL,20,Fmorning.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/4
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
