FL,337,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1787059119
OL,3,CFamily pay tribute to grandfather with
OL,4,C'heart of gold'
OL,6,FHe was remanded in custody and will
OL,7,Fappear at Sheffield Crown Court on
OL,8,FTuesday 18 August.
OL,10,FSouth Yorkshire Police say that to
OL,11,Ffollow standard protocol as Stephen
OL,12,Fhad previously been reported missing,
OL,13,Fit has referred itself to the
OL,14,FIndependent Office of Police Conduct.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/4
